# PDFs are build artifacts here; the site hosts the published copies, which are committed
# under docs/ (see microprediction/style, site_conventions.md — the gitignore asymmetry is
# deliberate: build artifact in papers/, site content in docs/).
*.pdf

# Exempt: these have no source in this repo, so they are not regenerable and are kept.
!Schur_Complementary_Portfolios_*.pdf
!arxiv/**/*.pdf
